{"v":4,"catch":"你需要移動所有阻止小貓的石頭。","desc":"Kitty 無法到達牠的目的地，因為牠的路徑有一些岩石。牠可以跳過岩石，但牠只是不想那樣做，因為牠聲稱很累。因此，為了這隻小貓的舒適，由你來承擔繁重的工作。\n\n聰明地移動石頭以讓路。\n\n遊戲作者：Minicactus Games","publisher":"QUByte Interactive","release":"2022-01-13","genres":["益智","策略","學習","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.8GB / Switch 0.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bec7d9ae01033709dcad9f215d28c741c8c02c14b580a3ebc88e2919ad617da8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c6d52f8de6c0f309328fc16778b297581e628041fcc86cd6d80c98693a93ffd7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2d0f0b528c0df45d7b55d3a76ea5c25c89e570dd62b31590ec0bb0e11367925.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d2a454e61f82d2024474c2c89583daa74f03fde0b51df3e45af31b79409f4527.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bff1a2773b8b85a69c01c2e3b4d4de637e7ce1251f02d871b3caa2d7187fdba3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7656e397ec3e0982610ba7573482e0ebdb004197abe0443f40749444a4a0bd06.jpg"],"titleId":"0100163015cb8000","dlc":[]}